      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我的耳机今天突然连不上手机了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "昨天还能用吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "能，昨天晚上还正常。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你先把蓝牙关掉再打开试试。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "试过了，还是找不到。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那耳机有没有电？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有，昨天刚充过。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可能要重新配对。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我不记得怎么进入配对模式。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我们可以先看说明，或者问店员。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我喜欢先自己试，但不想浪费太多时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那给自己五分钟，解决不了就问。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个方法不错。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你看，这里有一个小按钮。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "按几秒以后灯开始闪了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc029_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "现在手机应该能找到。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
